  "evidence": "The operator identifies the 1.9-mile Western course. Its published plan includes the Western Northern turnaround, central diagonal and inner Southern hairpin, Northern carousel, short Northeastern return and Eastern closing straight. These branches follow the independently inspected graded road alignment in public-domain July 2022 NAIP imagery. The operator construction history dates this period before final paving. The trace is a historical construction-alignment draft; finished pavement centerline, temporary barriers and fine corner alignment are unverified. It excludes the separate Eastern circuit, paddock and access roads. No operator or comparison diagram pixels supply course coordinates, and no coordinates are scaled to a nominal distance."
